## 4. Audit event schema

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/audit/OwnerCreatedEvent.java` — record serialized to JSON `{seq, ownerId, memberId, membershipLevel, event}`, `event` always `OWNER_CREATED`, `seq` monotonic:
