## 5. Owner segment (derived region)

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/OwnerSegment.java` — `<TIER>_<AREA>`. TIER = PREMIUM when membershipLevel ≥ 3 else STANDARD; AREA = METRO when region is a `CityRegion.isKnown` region (NSW/VIC/QLD) else REGIONAL:
```java
public static String of(Integer membershipLevel, String region) {
    String tier = membershipLevel != null && membershipLevel >= 3 ? "PREMIUM" : "STANDARD";
    String area = CityRegion.isKnown(region) ? "METRO" : "REGIONAL";
    return tier + "_" + area;
