- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/BusinessDayTest.java` — business-day rolling only; not identity-related (relevant only insofar as registrationDate feeds the memberId fiscal year).

No dedicated unit tests exist for `MemberId`, `OwnerIdentity`, `Household`, `OwnerSegment`, `OwnerRegion`, `RegionTimezone`, or `OwnerCreatedEvent`; their behaviour is exercised only through the acceptance layer.

